OL,3,AJFK, Boston and other US airports hit
OL,4,Aby delays after outage
OL,5,
OL,6,FGround stops have been ordered at major
OL,7,FUS airports in New York City, Boston
OL,8,Fand Philadelphia after a communications
OL,9,Fmalfunction impacting air traffic
OL,10,Fcontrol, the Federal Aviation
OL,11,FAdministration (FAA) says
OL,13,FDozens of flights were left stranded on
OL,14,Fthe runway Monday morning, with delays
OL,15,Fcontinuing to spread
OL,17,FThe issue is related to frequencies at
OL,18,Fthe Philadelphia air traffic control,
OL,19,Fwhich handles traffic for airports in
OL,20,Fthe region, according to US media
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
